.TH BACKGROUND 2 2000-1月 "metabolism.background" "metabolism.background"
.SH NAME
metabolism.background \- create kegg maps background for the metabolism data analysis
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fImetabolism.background(\fBkegg\fR as any, 
\fBfilter\fR as string = \fB<NULL>\fR, 
[\fB<Environment>\fR]);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
create kegg maps background for the metabolism data analysis
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBkegg\fB \fR\- Should be a collection of the kegg map object. 
.PP
.PP
\fBfilter\fB \fR\- 
 a character vector of the map id that will be kept in the background model,
 default \fBNULL\fR means all of the given maps will be used.
. 
.PP
.PP
\fBenv\fB \fR\- the R# runtime environment.. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
a [Background](cref:T:SMRUCC.genomics.Analysis.HTS.GSEA.Background) model that is created from the given KEGG maps.
.PP
